[[14050,5475,"An important issue in the Inquest was the continued prescription of Cionazepam by the Heaton Moor Medical Centre despite the written request on 17","continued prescription of Cionazepam",""],[14051,5475,"On receipt of request the drug was moved from the Repeat Prescription list to the Past Prescription list, without any reference in the records of the reason as to why the Clonazepam was being stopped","lack of recording of reasons for stopping medication",""],[14052,5475,"This is clearly an unacceptable error","error in prescription management",""],[14053,5475,"there were no standard directions as to how to manage this as a situation and that other practices may adopt the same simple policy of transferring the drug from one list to another","absence of standard directions",""]]